  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO Strengthening Institutional capacities in implementing Malawi Culture Policy in Line with UNESCO 2005 Convention on Culture Diversity in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building the capacity of stakeholders in the cultural sector to engage effecively in evidence based and participatory policy revision and monitoring process in accordance with principles and objectives of the 2005 Convention on the Protection and Promotion of the Diverity of Cultural Expressions</narrative>
  </description>
